(1, 'About Us', 'ABOUT', 'uploads/about/20240701-66826d7e75b9a.jpg', 'Who We Are', '<p>SS Group is a prominent and diversified consortium of companies that collectively represent a force to be reckoned with in various sectors. United by a commitment to excellence and a shared vision for success, we have solidified our position as a reliable provider of top-notch products and services across industries. The group of companies is one of the foremost business houses having heterogeneous business sectors in Development Work, Construction Work, Construction Materials Supply, Trading of Leather Goods, Trading of Imported Chemicals and Pigments, Supply of various Imported &amp; Local Gift Items, Interior Decoration Item Supply, General Trading and Export &amp; Imports, IT &amp; Software etc</p>', '[{\"title\":\"Relationships\",\"image\":\"uploads\\/about\\/20240701-66826d7e767cb.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Leadership\",\"image\":\"uploads\\/about\\/20240701-66826f5f30298.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Performance\",\"image\":\"uploads\\/about\\/20240701-66826fb0ad29a.jpg\"}]', 'About Us', NULL, '2024-07-01 02:49:02', '2024-07-01 02:58:24');

