(1, 'Faq', 'Faq', 'uploads/faq/20240706-668953521c658.jpg', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 'Ask What You Want To Know', 'uploads/faq/20240507-663a78986304f.png', '[{\"answer\": \"We understand that time is of the essence. We strive to provide efficient services, and our turnaround times may vary depending on the specific service and project scope. Feel free to inquire about estimated timelines when requesting a quote.\", \"question\": \"What is the typical turnaround time for your BPO services?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Requesting a quote is easy. Simply visit our Contact Us page and fill out the form with your details and specific requirements. Our team will get in touch with you promptly to provide a customized quote.\", \"question\": \"How can I request a quote for your services?\"}, {\"answer\": \"We have experience serving various industries, including healthcare, data solutions, and technology. Our industry-specific expertise allows us to tailor our BPO solutions to meet the unique needs of each sector.\", \"question\": \"What industries does Qligence specialize in?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Absolutely. Data security is of utmost importance to us. We implement strict security measures to protect your sensitive information. Visit our Security page to learn more about our data protection protocols.\", \"question\": \"Is data security a priority at Qligence?\"}, {\"answer\": \"We provide transparent project tracking and reporting. When you engage our services, you\'ll receive access to a dedicated client portal where you can monitor project milestones, review updates, and communicate with our team in real-time.\", \"question\": \"How can I track the progress of my project with Qligence?\"}]', 'Still Have More Questions?', 'Contact Our', 'Expert Support Team', '/contact', NULL, NULL, '2024-05-07 12:53:12', '2024-07-06 10:51:50');

