(1, 'Mission, Vision & Core Values', 'MISSION, VISION & CORE VALUES', 'uploads/about/20240701-66826fe455406.jpg', 'Our Mission, Vision & Core Values', '<p>Our objective is to become a trusted brand in the BPO industry by providing top-notch services and to our clients. We have served numerous clients from multiple countries throughout our journey. As a fast-growing company, we want to reach new milestones and help businesses achieve their objectives through the sustainable and responsible application of technology.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Our Mission', '<p>To empower businesses worldwide through innovative BPO solutions, fostering growth, efficiency, and sustainable success.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Our Vision', '<p>At Qligence, we envision revolutionizing the BPO industry by consistently delivering unparalleled service excellence, driving transformative outcomes for our clients, and inspiring enduring partnerships built on trust and integrity.</p>', 'Core Values', '<p><strong>Excellence</strong>: We strive for excellence in all that we do.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Integrity</strong>: We conduct ourselves with honesty and integrity at all times.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Innovation</strong>: We embrace innovation to drive continuous improvement.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Accountability</strong>: We take responsibility for our actions and outcomes.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Customer Focus</strong>: We prioritize the needs and satisfaction of our customers.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Growth</strong>: We are committed to personal and professional growth for our team members.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Welcome to Qligence. We are a team of experienced professionals with the aim of delivering high-quality BPO services around the world.', NULL, '2024-05-03 02:59:21', '2024-07-01 02:59:16');

