INSERT INTO `privacy_policy_cms` (`id`, `banner_title`, `page_title`, `banner_image`, `details`, `meta`, `meta_description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1, 'Privacy Policy', 'Privacy Policy', 'uploads/privacy_policy/20240507-663a7455ee336.jpg', '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Privacy Policy</strong></h3>\r\n<p>How Qligence Ltd. (\"Qligence,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\") collects, uses, maintains, and discloses information about users of our website and services (referred to as \"you\" or \"your\" in this policy) is governed by this Privacy Policy. We pledge to respect your privacy and treat your personal data with the utmost care. All users who visit our website (qligence.com) or utilize our IT services and BPO solutions are subject to our privacy policy.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Information We Collect</strong></p>\r\n<p>Personal Information: When you voluntarily give us personal information, such as when you fill out forms on our website, sign up for our newsletter, ask for information, or conduct business with us, we may collect your personal information. We may gather a variety of different kinds of personal data, including but not limited to:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Your full name</li>\r\n<li>Your email address</li>\r\n<li>Your contact number</li>\r\n<li>Name of the company</li>\r\n<li>Your position</li>\r\n<li>Billing and shipping addresses</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Payment details</strong></p>\r\n<p>Non-Personal Information: When you interact with our website, we may automatically gather non-personal information about you, such as your IP address, browser type, operating system, device information, and usage patterns. Cookies and other similar technologies are used to collect this data.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Use of Information</strong></p>\r\n<p>The following are some potential uses for the data we may have collected from you:</p>\r\n<p>To offer and enhance our services</p>\r\n<p>To address your questions and meet your requirements</p>\r\n<p>To send you promotional emails and newsletters (you can always opt out at any time)</p>\r\n<p>To handle payments for the provided services</p>\r\n<p>To identify, address, and fix any technical problems or security flaws</p>\r\n<p>To uphold our rights and adhere to legal requirements</p>\r\n<p><strong>Data Security</strong></p>\r\n<p>To prevent unauthorized access, change, disclosure, or destruction of your personal information, we use industry-standard security procedures. Please understand, however, that no form of electronic communication via the internet or storage is 100% safe, and we cannot ensure 100% security every time.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Data Retention</strong></p>\r\n<p>Unless a longer retention time is required or allowed by law, we will only keep your personal information as long as it takes to achieve the goals mentioned in this privacy policy. Upon your request, we will delete your personal information, subject to any legal requirements or legitimate interests that call for the preservation of specific data.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Disclosure to Third Parties</strong></p>\r\n<p>Your personal information is not traded, sold, or rented to outside parties by us. However, as long as they agree to keep your information private, we might disclose it to related external service providers who help us run our website, run our business, or provide for your needs.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Your Rights</strong></p>\r\n<p>Regarding your personal information, you have the following rights:</p>\r\n<p>The ability to view, modify, or remove your personal data</p>\r\n<p>The choice to stop receiving our promotional emails or newsletters</p>\r\n<p>The option to revoke your agreement to the processing of your personal data</p>\r\n<p>Having the option to lodge a complaint with a data protection authority</p>\r\n<p>Please get in touch with us to request that we exercise these rights or make related requests.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Third-Party Websites</strong></p>\r\n<p>Links to third-party websites, plugins, or apps that are not within Qligence\'s control or ownership may be found on our website. We suggest studying their privacy policies before submitting any personal information since we are not liable for the privacy practices of any third-party websites.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Privacy Policy Updates</strong></p>\r\n<p>We could periodically amend this privacy policy to reflect adjustments to our procedures, technological advancements, statutory obligations, or other factors. The revised Privacy Policy will be published on our website. In order to be informed about how we collect, utilize, and safeguard your information, we encourage you to review this Privacy Policy on a regular basis.</p>\r\n<p>You accept and agree to the new terms by using our website or our services after any modifications have been made to this Privacy Policy.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Contact Us</strong></p>\r\n<p>Please don\'t hesitate to get in touch with us if you have any questions or issues about this privacy policy or our procedures.</p>', NULL, NULL, '2024-05-07 12:35:01', '2024-05-07 12:35:19');

