INSERT INTO `services` (`id`, `category_id`, `category_name`, `title`, `slug`, `image`, `detail`, `why_qligence_detail`, `meta`, `meta_description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1, '2', 'S.S Enterprise', 'Back-office support shouldn’t be back-of-minds', 'back-office-support-shouldnt-be-back-of-minds', '[{\"title\":\"S.S Enterprise\",\"image\":\"uploads\\/service\\/20240706-66894b07eb8e0.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"S.S Enterprise\",\"image\":\"uploads\\/service\\/20240706-66894b07ebd1c.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"S.S Enterprise\",\"image\":\"uploads\\/service\\/20240706-66894b07ec0a7.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"S.S Enterprise\",\"image\":\"uploads\\/service\\/20240706-66894b07ec44a.png\"}]', '<p>S.S Enterprise started its journey with the hand of Mr. Md. Abu Sadeq in 2005. From the very begging firm is engaged with trading and supply/souring agent of various gift items, stationary items, sports item along with this trading businesses, firm is also engaged with on demand supplies of various imported items. &nbsp;The business has created a hefty number of loyal customers over the last several years. Presently firm is dealing with various large corporate house e.g. Novertis (Bangladesh), OpsoninPharma Limited, Radient Pharmaceuticals Limited and The ACME Laboratories Limited etc.&nbsp;</p>', '[{\"answer\": \"With proven experience supporting back-office services for more than 60 global brands in verticals – including financial services​ and payments, technology, consumer products and retail,​ media and entertainment, communications, healthcare and utilities​ – Foundever brings industry best practices to add value to your back office and CX strategy needs\", \"question\": \"Back-office experience in every vertical\"}, {\"answer\": \"Whether it’s data entry, payment processing and customer correspondence for fast-moving consumer goods (FMCG) companies, account management and supply chain management in the automotive industry or compliance oversight and claims processing in insurance – the only element of our service that remains the same is the quality of our people and the levels of training they receive.\", \"question\": \"Customized back-office solutions\"}]', 'Welcome to Qligence. We are a team of experienced professionals with the aim of delivering high-quality BPO services around the world.', NULL, '2024-05-05 01:01:47', '2024-07-06 07:47:51'),
(2, '3', 'Qligence', 'Back-office support shouldn’t be back-of-mind', 'back-office-support-shouldnt-be-back-of-mind', '[{\"title\":\"Qligence Office\",\"image\":\"uploads\\/service\\/20240706-66894ab2d4bef.jpg\"}]', '<p>Qligence is a fast-growing digital company offering reliable and personalized IT services and BPO solutions. Being a sister concern of SS Group, Qligence aims to revolutionize businesses and organizations by incorporating user-friendly and innovative digital services</p>', '[{\"answer\": \"With a global eNPS of 52 in 2022, our people are highly engaged and committed to delivering rapid resolutions that leave a lasting impression on behalf of your brand. They know how to connect with your customers and, as your business grows, our people – whether onshore, nearshore, offshore or working at home – are ready and waiting to deliver memorable and effortless customer experiences\", \"question\": \"CX powered by a culture of care\"}, {\"answer\": \"Our experts develop conversations that engage across the CX journey. We seamlessly connect customer flows from automated and self-service channels and bots into human-assisted channels with brand-aligned conversational design. Every step your customer takes with your brand builds a deeper long-term relationship\", \"question\": \"Building conversational omnichannel CX\"}, {\"answer\": \"We’ve successfully scaled by +4,000 associates for a brand in less than six weeks. Whether attracting highly specialized skills or rapidly scaling to meet unplanned demand, our digital hiring model attuned to your specific requirements is ready to connect your customers to the best CX talent\", \"question\": \"Digital hiring to scale with the best talent\"}]', 'Welcome to Qligence. We are a team of experienced professionals with the aim of delivering high-quality BPO services around the world.', NULL, '2024-05-05 01:40:00', '2024-07-06 07:46:26'),
(3, '4', 'SS High-tech Industries Ltd.', 'Deliver growth through deeper customer connections', 'deliver-growth-through-deeper-customer-connections', '[{\"title\":\"Earth Cutting\",\"image\":\"uploads\\/service\\/20240706-668945ad50372.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Sand Filling\",\"image\":\"uploads\\/service\\/20240706-668945ad50ac8.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Dredging work\",\"image\":\"uploads\\/service\\/20240706-668945ad50fc5.jpg\"}]', '<div>First S.S Enterprise (Pvt.) Ltd. is a corporate business house in Bangladesh. The company was incorporated as private limited company under companies&rsquo; act 1994 and duly registered with the Registrar of Joint Stock &amp; Companies and Firm the Govt. of the People&rsquo;s Republic of Bangladesh. From the very begging company is engaged with various construction and development work as a constructions materials supplier &amp; contractor. Corporate office of the firm is situated at Mohammadia Housing Society, Mohammadpur, Dhaka, Bangladesh. The company is committed to create a hefty number of loyal customers in the imminent days. Actually the company is a successful outcome of Managing Director&rsquo;s previous proprietorship business which was namely &ldquo;S.S Enterprise&rdquo;.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>WORKING AREAS:</strong></div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>1. As a First Class Contractor &amp;Construction Materials Supplier:</div>\r\n<div>a) Earth Cutting</div>\r\n<div>b) Sand Filling,</div>\r\n<div>c) Various Steel and Shed Constructions,</div>\r\n<div>d) Various Building/Major Constructions,</div>\r\n<div>e) Road Development &amp; Constructions,</div>\r\n<div>f) Rail Line Constructions</div>\r\n<div>g) Dredging work,</div>\r\n<div>h) Supplier of Various Construction Materials:</div>\r\n<div>i. Rod</div>\r\n<div>ii. Cement</div>\r\n<div>iii. Sand</div>\r\n<div>iv. Bricks</div>\r\n<div>v. Stone</div>\r\n<div>i) Supplier of Various Development Materials:</div>\r\n<div>i. Geo-Textile Bags</div>\r\n<div>ii. CC Blocks</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>', '[{\"answer\": \"Foundever combines proven sales practices and fully customizable training modules available in multiple languages to support and guide sales talent at every stage of the customer journey.\", \"question\": \"Global sales expertise and processes\"}, {\"answer\": \"With Foundever leadership in AI and Analytics, our ability to understand your customers and their behaviors gives you the insight to develop and grow your revenue. Powered by predictive insights, our sales and customer retention programs help you increase your customers’ lifetime value.\", \"question\": \"Data intelligence to grow your sales program\"}, {\"answer\": \"Drive conversion and revenue growth by equipping your sales and retention teams with Foundever solutions. Our offering includes a unified agent desktop platform to ensure your sales and retention teams have the customer data they need to deliver, through AI-enabled agent assist technology to recommend the next-best action.\", \"question\": \"Equipping teams with the tools for success\"}]', 'Welcome to Qligence. We are a team of experienced professionals with the aim of delivering high-quality BPO services around the world.', NULL, '2024-05-05 01:43:58', '2024-07-06 07:25:01');

